                  </p>
                </div>
                <div className="rounded-lg bg-white/[0.04] p-3 sm:p-4">
                  <p className="text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] text-white/45 uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">
                    Series totales
                  </p>
                  <p className="text-[13px] sm:text-[14px] font-bold text-white/85">
